TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
SUMMARY:RPG 2027: Abstract submission (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:IET International Conference on Renewable Power Generation and 
 Future Power Systems (RPG 2027)\n\nAbstract submission: 15 Mar 2027\, 23:5
 9 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConference: October 29-31\, 2027\nLocation: Shanghai
 \, China\n\nAll dates:\n  Abstract submission: 15 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 
 (assumed)\n  Notification of abstract acceptance: 2 Apr 2027\, 23:59 UTC+1
 2 (assumed)\n  Submission of full papers: 17 May 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assu
 med)\n  Notification of full paper acceptance: 14 Jun 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 
 (assumed)\n  Requested rework paper submission: 28 Jun 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12
  (assumed)\n  Paper modification deadline: 9 Jul 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assu
 med)\n  Early bird registration: 26 Jul 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nT
 he call for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the ear
 liest it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real 
 deadline rather than after it.\n\nRPG China 2027\, the 16th edition\, orga
 nised jointly with Shanghai Jiao Tong University. The conference landing p
 age gives 2 April 2027 for full papers\, but the author information page l
 ists 2 April as the abstract notification and 17 May 2027 for full papers\
 ; the author information page is followed here.\n\nCall for papers: https:
 //renewablepower.theiet.org/rpg-china-2027\nDetails: https://powersystemde
 adlines.org/conference/rpg-china27
LOCATION:Shanghai\, China
URL;VALUE=URI:https://renewablepower.theiet.org/rpg-china-2027
CATEGORIES:Renewables,Power Systems,Energy Markets,EV & Transportation,Ener
 gy Storage
